how-561"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #561","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-561.jpg","content":"UK sounds and unreleased music inspired by Joe's recent trip.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2022-08-13T08:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"tfL_MijRVxE","position":3,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Soul II Soul - Back To Life (Acapella)","track":{"id":"PT-sbQD0ecU","path":"/artists/soul-ii-soul/tracks/back-to-life-acapella/","slug":"back-to-life-acapella","title":"Back To Life (Acapella)","artist":{"slug":"soul-ii-soul","title":"Soul II Soul"},"artwork":"images/artists/soul-ii-soul/tracks/back-to-life-acapella.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"PXQa1HxDvAg","slug":"136","tags":[1,2,15],"links":{"mixcloud":"https://www.mixcloud.com/soulection/show-136-w-astronautica/"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #136 w/ Astronautica","artwork":"/images/episodes/136.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10761,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-07-13T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":2}},{"id":"V9d3MQmtucs","position":7,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Soul II Soul - Back To Life (Acapella)","track":{"id":"PT-sbQD0ecU","path":"/artists/soul-ii-soul/tracks/back-to-life-acapella/","slug":"back-to-life-acapella","title":"Back To Life (Acapella)","artist":{"slug":"soul-ii-soul","title":"Soul II Soul"},"artwork":"images/artists/soul-ii-soul/tracks/back-to-life-acapella.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"IgJtl2M_Vk0","slug":"140","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-140-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #140 w/ Esta & Andres","artwork":"/images/episodes/140.jpg","content":"\nESTA and Andres stop on by and deliver solid sets.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nHad to start this show with a new unreleased gem from Kaytra and play all the classics/unreleased material as usual. Esta finally stopped by to drop an official set and talk about what's next for him. He really impressed us with his house vibes. This man is diverse. Andres also came through and graced us with a heavy hitter set. Spread this if you feel it.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10805,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-10T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"WLIvoyWKPqs","position":30,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Soul II Soul - Back To Life (Acapella)","track":{"id":"PT-sbQD0ecU","path":"/artists/soul-ii-soul/tracks/back-to-life-acapella/","slug":"back-to-life-acapella","title":"Back To Life (Acapella)","artist":{"slug":"soul-ii-soul","title":"Soul II Soul"},"artwork":"images/artists/soul-ii-soul/tracks/back-to-life-acapella.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"F65IztEdKlQ","slug":"158","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-158-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #158 w/ Kronika","artwork":"/images/episodes/158.jpg","content":"Joe Kay & Kronika hold it down with gems randing from unreleased to forthcoming material, plus forgotten classics. \n\n<!--more-->\nHere is our last the last show of 2013 and ending it with a BANG. \n\nEvery week just keeps getting better and better for us. The music, the accomplishments, and ideas just keep rising. \n\nThis week was supposed to be a ladies edition of Soulection Radio w/ Sasha Marie, Eden, and Kronika but Sasha and Eden both couldn't make it out this time along. \n\nWe'll catch you in 2014 and thank you again for your support. We appreciate you.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10838,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-12-28T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"xtnFhORlExQ","position":13,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Soul II Soul - Keep On Movin'","track":{"id":"XWen6GDMJMc","path":"/artists/soul-ii-soul/tracks/keep-on-movin/","slug":"keep-on-movin","title":"Keep On Movin'","artist":{"slug":"soul-ii-soul","title":"Soul II Soul"},"artwork":"images/artists/soul-ii-soul/tracks/keep-on-movin.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"F65IztEdKlQ","slug":"158","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-158-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #158 w/ Kronika","artwork":"/images/episodes/158.jpg","content":"Joe Kay & Kronika hold it down with gems randing from unreleased to forthcoming material, plus forgotten classics. \n\n<!--more-->\nHere is our last the last show of 2013 and ending it with a BANG. \n\nEvery week just keeps getting better and better for us. The music, the accomplishments, and ideas just keep rising. \n\nThis week was supposed to be a ladies edition of Soulection Radio w/ Sasha Marie, Eden, and Kronika but Sasha and Eden both couldn't make it out this time along. \n\nWe'll catch you in 2014 and thank you again for your support. We appreciate you.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10838,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-12-28T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Kronika's Set + Interview","position":1}},{"id":"Cma_WpVjLtI","position":55,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Soul II Soul - Back To Life","track":{"id":"MU6oLIsuIIs","path":"/artists/soul-ii-soul/tracks/back-to-life/","slug":"back-to-life","title":"Back To Life","artist":{"slug":"soul-ii-soul","title":"Soul II Soul"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"AfbBMadJe6c","slug":"162","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-162"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #162","artwork":"/images/episodes/162.jpg","content":"Joe reaches out to the listeners for the People Choice\n\n<!--more-->\n\nComing off Grammy week connections and our 3 Year Anniversary we returned for yet another solid show. Our special guests who were scheduled for this show couldn't make it but Joe Kay brought out a variety of new and classic gems from the Soulection crates. This show was really engaging because Joe reached out to all the listeners and asked the audience what they wanted to hear via social media. It was amazing to see how many people were listening and how many people requested for a certain track. For the last hour and 1/2 you the people we're DJ'ing/selecting music! How amazing right? Try to tune in live next time. The live feelings is always better. We'll catch you next week at the same time. Spread this if you feel it because it really is strictly about the music. Stay tuned for our 3 Year Anniversary Party announcement on Monday (1/27/14).\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10811,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-01-18T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"PlUYmdjmJUQ","position":26,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Soul II Soul - Back To Life (Acapella)","track":{"id":"PT-sbQD0ecU","path":"/artists/soul-ii-soul/tracks/back-to-life-acapella/","slug":"back-to-life-acapella","title":"Back To Life (Acapella)","artist":{"slug":"soul-ii-soul","title":"Soul II Soul"},"artwork":"images/artists/soul-ii-soul/tracks/back-to-life-acapella.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"QURVhAvlK44","slug":"208","tags":[7,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-208-w-elhae"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #208 w/ Elhae","artwork":"/images/episodes/208.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10883,"location":"US","published_at":"2015-03-15T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"id":"G_0cf7Nm1jg","position":35,"timesta